## Ringkasan:
```
INSERT  → tambah data baru
UPDATE  → ubah data (SELALU pakai WHERE!)
DELETE  → hapus data (lebih baik soft delete)

COUNT   → hitung baris
SUM     → total nilai
AVG     → rata-rata
MIN/MAX → terkecil/terbesar

GROUP BY → kelompokkan data
HAVING   → filter hasil grouping
WHERE    → filter sebelum grouping